{"4178140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Moorage", "steam_appid": 4178140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moorage </strong>is a first-person 3D fishing roguelite where you play as a fisher lost at sea. Meet those stranded like you, craft using fish parts, and set out to find the source of the waves. Or, better yet, a way home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CATCH FISH!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 150 different fish and 9 biomes to explore, you can catch anything from the humble sand smelt to a naval mine fish?? Complete your bestiary, find the most bizarre fish, and get tons of rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178140/extras/c969c019b583bfeda51457c5dd31654c.poster.avif?t=1788055264\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178140/extras/c969c019b583bfeda51457c5dd31654c.webm?t=1788055264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178140/extras/c969c019b583bfeda51457c5dd31654c.mp4?t=1788055264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NOT YOUR AVERAGE FISHING!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core fishing minigame is inspired by Undyne's fight in Undertale and rhythm games such as Music Diver or Osu! Move the green bar to catch the incoming arrows. Catch them all to reel in a big one!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178140/extras/bc1ffe0cdc0a9a08fc9be54ad61cd7c1.poster.avif?t=1788055264\" width=1170 height=688 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178140/extras/bc1ffe0cdc0a9a08fc9be54ad61cd7c1.webm?t=1788055264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178140/extras/bc1ffe0cdc0a9a08fc9be54ad61cd7c1.mp4?t=1788055264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CRAFT, COOK, AND SURVIVE!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the excess fish you have to feed yourself or craft unique items. Additionally, you may meet some people on the water who can help you reach your destination...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178140/extras/85601755b84ae271b88b9df066fd11dc.poster.avif?t=1788055264\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178140/extras/85601755b84ae271b88b9df066fd11dc.webm?t=1788055264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178140/extras/85601755b84ae271b88b9df066fd11dc.mp4?t=1788055264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOSING MAKES YOU STRONGER!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to the island to explore, progress the story, and learn more about the people stranded here. Sell your fish, buy new rods, and select new modifiers to make your next fishing journey a good one!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178140/extras/49ef4d165e17af8a7d420fc8a2870ce3.poster.avif?t=1788055264\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178140/extras/49ef4d165e17af8a7d420fc8a2870ce3.webm?t=1788055264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178140/extras/49ef4d165e17af8a7d420fc8a2870ce3.mp4?t=1788055264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTERS GROW, INTERACT WITH EACH OTHER, AND MAYBE... LIKE YOU???</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bond with the characters on the island! You can invite them on your boat and spend time with them. You could even spark a romance if you're feeling lucky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178140/extras/a04a79d1ac85e57b59e53bac1f86b25a.poster.avif?t=1788055264\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178140/extras/a04a79d1ac85e57b59e53bac1f86b25a.webm?t=1788055264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178140/extras/a04a79d1ac85e57b59e53bac1f86b25a.mp4?t=1788055264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moorage </strong>is a first-person 3D fishing roguelite where you play as a fisher lost at sea. Meet those stranded like you, craft using fish parts, and set out to find the source of the waves. Or, better yet, a way home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CATCH FISH!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 150 different fish and 9 biomes to explore, you can catch anything from the humble sand smelt to a naval mine fish?? Complete your bestiary, find the most bizarre fish, and get tons of rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178140/extras/c969c019b583bfeda51457c5dd31654c.poster.avif?t=1788055264\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178140/extras/c969c019b583bfeda51457c5dd31654c.webm?t=1788055264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178140/extras/c969c019b583bfeda51457c5dd31654c.mp4?t=1788055264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NOT YOUR AVERAGE FISHING!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core fishing minigame is inspired by Undyne's fight in Undertale and rhythm games such as Music Diver or Osu! Move the green bar to catch the incoming arrows. Catch them all to reel in a big one!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178140/extras/bc1ffe0cdc0a9a08fc9be54ad61cd7c1.poster.avif?t=1788055264\" width=1170 height=688 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178140/extras/bc1ffe0cdc0a9a08fc9be54ad61cd7c1.webm?t=1788055264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178140/extras/bc1ffe0cdc0a9a08fc9be54ad61cd7c1.mp4?t=1788055264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CRAFT, COOK, AND SURVIVE!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the excess fish you have to feed yourself or craft unique items. Additionally, you may meet some people on the water who can help you reach your destination...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178140/extras/85601755b84ae271b88b9df066fd11dc.poster.avif?t=1788055264\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178140/extras/85601755b84ae271b88b9df066fd11dc.webm?t=1788055264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178140/extras/85601755b84ae271b88b9df066fd11dc.mp4?t=1788055264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOSING MAKES YOU STRONGER!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to the island to explore, progress the story, and learn more about the people stranded here. Sell your fish, buy new rods, and select new modifiers to make your next fishing journey a good one!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178140/extras/49ef4d165e17af8a7d420fc8a2870ce3.poster.avif?t=1788055264\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178140/extras/49ef4d165e17af8a7d420fc8a2870ce3.webm?t=1788055264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178140/extras/49ef4d165e17af8a7d420fc8a2870ce3.mp4?t=1788055264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTERS GROW, INTERACT WITH EACH OTHER, AND MAYBE... LIKE YOU???</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bond with the characters on the island! You can invite them on your boat and spend time with them. You could even spark a romance if you're feeling lucky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178140/extras/a04a79d1ac85e57b59e53bac1f86b25a.poster.avif?t=1788055264\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178140/extras/a04a79d1ac85e57b59e53bac1f86b25a.webm?t=1788055264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178140/extras/a04a79d1ac85e57b59e53bac1f86b25a.mp4?t=1788055264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Moorage is a fishing roguelite where you must travel the ocean to find a way off a desolate island. Meet people stranded like you, level up each time you fail, and catch a bunch of fish!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178140/018a8e044e8e9c6dd3cbcaee2daae99626e1b87d/header.jpg?t=1788055264", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178140/c69286d7bb736cb1318c20be2dd641d436c0fe9c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788055264", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4178140/c69286d7bb736cb1318c20be2dd641d436c0fe9c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788055264", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 9.0c compatible video card<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 150 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> High Sierra 10.13+ (Intel processors) Big Sur 11.0 (Apple silicon-based processors).<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Both<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Metal-capable Intel and AMD GPUs.<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Daedalus Studios"], "publishers": ["Daedalus Studios"], "demos": [{"appid": 4418840, "description": ""}], "price_overview": 